  "body": "This immaculate 3-bedroom, 2-bathroom home blends character, space, and low-maintenance living and ticks all the boxes! Its sun-drenched, north-facing position offers year-round warmth, bright, light aspect, and fabulous entertaining through the summer months, all in an elevated, private, sought-after location.\r\n\r\nThe spacious main living area and two generous bedrooms, along with a main full bathroom, sit conveniently on one level. Here, the seamless flow between the kitchen, dining, and separate lounge effortlessly opens up to large private decks-perfect for hosting friends or unwinding after a long day. Picture yourself soaking under the stars in your very own spa pool, creating memories that warm the heart.\r\n \r\nVenture downstairs to find a versatile space that adapts to your lifestyle- whether that be the extra-large 3rd bedroom/rumpus area or currently used to run a business out of, all complemented by a full laundry, WC, and shower. You can adapt as your family's needs change!\r\n\r\nThe landscaped grounds, flat lawn for the kids to play, and extra-large shed for tools and toys ensure the whole family is catered for. With abundant parking options, including a covered carport with a 15 Amp socket for EV charging and off-street parking for cars, a camper, or even a boat, your practical needs are met with ease.\r\n\r\nSet back from the road on a quiet street, this home is centrally located within walking distance to Stanmore Bay Primary School and near Stanmore Bay Beach, the Leisure Centre, and Stanmore Bay Primary. Commuting is a breeze with easy access to bus routes and main roads to the North Shore and City.\r\n\r\nThis is a property that needs to be inspected to appreciate what's on offer! Call today",
